stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Unselected
  Unselected --> Ready: select valid table
  Ready --> Ready: identical refresh preserves view
  Ready --> Ready: sort or filter matching rows
  Ready --> Empty: filter excludes all rows
  Empty --> Ready: clear or reset
  Ready --> Downloaded: download / acquire URL and revoke after click
  Downloaded --> Downloaded: repeated download / independent URL
  Ready --> Refused: acquisition or click throws / revoke acquired URL
  Refused --> Downloaded: retry succeeds
  Ready --> Invalid: invalid refreshed block
  Invalid --> Ready: valid refresh
  Ready --> Ready: changed content or selection / reset view
  Ready --> Unselected: clear or auth retirement / dispose
  Downloaded --> Unselected: dispose / no URL retained
  Unselected --> Unselected: stale completion / no async work
